#: apps/core/management/commands/startapp.py:13
msgid ""
"Create a Django app, fix its dotted app path, and register it in LOCAL_APPS. "
"A plain name creates the app at project root. A path creates it at that path. "
"Examples: startapp orders, startapp apps/orders, startapp orders apps/orders."
msgstr ""
"ينشئ تطبيق Django، ويصحح مساره النقطي، ويسجله في LOCAL_APPS. الاسم البسيط "
"ينشئ التطبيق في جذر المشروع. والمسار ينشئه في ذلك المسار. أمثلة: startapp "
"orders، startapp apps/orders، startapp orders apps/orders."

#: apps/core/management/commands/startapp.py:28
msgid "App already exists: %(path)s"
msgstr "التطبيق موجود بالفعل: %(path)s"

#: apps/core/management/commands/startapp.py:44
msgid "Created and registered app: %(app_path)s"
msgstr "تم إنشاء التطبيق وتسجيله: %(app_path)s"

#: apps/core/management/commands/startapp.py:51
msgid "Invalid app name: %(app_name)s. Use a valid Python identifier."
msgstr "اسم التطبيق غير صالح: %(app_name)s. استخدم معرّف Python صالحًا."

#: apps/core/management/commands/startapp.py:69
msgid "App path must be a relative package path."
msgstr "يجب أن يكون مسار التطبيق مسار حزمة نسبيًا."

#: apps/core/management/commands/startapp.py:111
msgid "Could not find end of LOCAL_APPS in project/settings/local.py"
msgstr "تعذر العثور على نهاية LOCAL_APPS في project/settings/local.py"

#: apps/core/management/commands/startapp.py:118
msgid "Could not find LOCAL_APPS in project/settings/local.py"
msgstr "تعذر العثور على LOCAL_APPS في project/settings/local.py"

